OL,3,GNEWSABin crew save man's life after tin
OL,4,Asevers artery
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix bin men are being praised as heroes
OL,7,Fafter saving a man's life while on
OL,8,Fduty.
OL,10,FJack Moxon was taking out his recycling
OL,11,Fin Cannock, Staffordshire, when he cut
OL,12,Fhis wrist on the lid of a tin, severing
OL,13,Fan artery.
OL,15,FHospital staff told him that without
OL,16,Ffirst aid treatment, he would have bled
OL,17,Fout within five to eight minutes.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
