OL,3,GNEWSABin crew save man's life after tin
OL,4,Asevers artery
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an emotional reunion with the men
OL,7,Fwho saved his life, Jack, originally
OL,8,Ffrom Birmingham, said: "I can't thank
OL,9,Fthem enough for it. They are the ones
OL,10,Fthat saved my life, big time. If it
OL,11,Fweren't for them, I wouldn't be here
OL,12,Fnow."
